Module axis vs the URDF joint. With EXO-170 the origin is no longer ON the joint origin: it is on the joint AXIS, `slide` mm along it. So what is checked is the axis direction and the PERPENDICULAR distance from the module origin to the URDF axis line - the two numbers the kinematics depend on - plus the slide itself.
